20
00:00:20,734 --> 00:00:21,197
Sweden,

21
00:00:21,197 --> 00:00:21,543
1978.

22
00:00:21,543 --> 00:00:23,149
Brabham's designer,

23
00:00:23,149 --> 00:00:24,074
Gordon Murray,

24
00:00:24,074 --> 00:00:25,699
put a giant fan

